      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Endpoints (API setter regler)\nGET /Tasks\nPOST /Tasks\nDELETE /Tasks/{id}\nPATCH /Tasks/{id}\n\n2. Input (Hva frontend sender):\nPOST /Tasks\n{\n    \"title\": \"Avskaffe monarkiet part ??\"\n}\n\n3. Output (Hva backend returnerer):\n{\n    \"id\": ds89gd\n    \"title\": \"Avskaffe monarkiet part ??\"\n    \"isCompleted\": False\n} (JSON)",
